module collections

; Persistent, snapshot-stable collection APIs are part of the language core.
; This module exposes the default immutable family:
;   Array[T], Set[T], SortedSet[T], Queue[T], Stack[T], Deque[T], Bag[T],
;   Dictionary[K, V], SortedMap[K, V], PriorityQueue[T], Pair[A, B], Range.
; Mutable collections intentionally live in the sibling namespace
; collections/mutable and keep side effects explicit and isolated.

; Constructors and builders are available through the type object:
;   (Array[int]) new [1, 2, 3]
;   (Set[int]) new [1, 2, 2]
;   (Dictionary[tag, int]) new #{a: 1, b: 2}
;   (PriorityQueue[int]) new
